flowchart LR
  Q[User query] --> T[Query transform: hyde or sub-questions]
  T --> Route[Adaptive router]
  Route --> V[Vector]
  Route --> K[Keyword]
  Route --> G[GraphRAG]
  Route --> F[Federated]
  V & K & G & F --> Perm[Permission filter]
  Perm --> Ctx[Context]
  Ctx --> LLM[Generate]
  LLM --> Ground[Grounding check]
  Ground --> Ans[Answer + citations]
